  dialogue:
  - '"what have you been getting up to in your free time...?"'
  - "I\u2019ve been reading through some of the museum\u2019s digital collection\u2013or,
    gallery, I guess.\r\nI read comics the most, and it\u2019s pretty fun to see
    how the characters and setting change over time."
  - 'Like the character Plainclothes Pace, who starts off in a fairly normal setting,
    but in stories decades later, travels to the moon and meets aliens!

'
  responses:
  - responseText: Introduction to comics?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 0}
    responseChange: 0
  - responseText: Thoughts on superheroes?
